# FORM.C: the messages of the forms (MF_).
250 MF_REQUIRED This field must be filled in
251 MF_BADNUM Not a valid number for this field
252 MF_NEGNUM The number may not be negative
253 MF_BADDATE Not a valid date (YYYY-MM-DD)
254 MF_BADCHOICE Not one of the choices (F4 shows them)
255 MF_YN YN
# W=30 memo field: FORM_MEMODISP
256 MF_MEMOLINES Lines: ^1 (F4 to open)
257 MF_MEMONEW (after saving)

258 MF_SAVEMEMO Save the record with Enter first, then write the notes
259 MF_PARTIAL The record was added; some fields may not have been saved
260 MF_MEMOKEY F4 opens the notes
